7086:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c **** /**
7087:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @brief  Configure the TI1 as Input.
7088:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIMx to select the TIM peripheral.
